<title>CHINA: China copper production line put into operation.</title>
<headline>China copper production line put into operation.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dabao Mountain, the biggest iron mine in Guangdong province in south China, on Friday put into operation a production line capable of handling 1,000 tonnes of copper ore a day, the Xinhua news agency said.</p>
<p>Dabao Mountain has reserves of 74.95 million tonnes of copper and 33.15 million tonnes of sulphur, Xinhua said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
